        <h3>Metals Warehousing</h3>
        <p>Metal storage and handling for copper, aluminum, steel, and other non-ferrous and scrap metal, with inventory control and documentation built for exchange-grade material.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Trade</span>
        <h3>FTZ &amp; Bonded Warehousing</h3>
        <p>Shelby County and the City of Memphis jointly administer an active Foreign-Trade Zone program. Ask about FTZ subzone status and bonded warehouse / duty deferral storage for your product — a customs bonded warehouse option worth checking before you route product elsewhere in Tennessee.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Bulk</span>
        <h3>Bulk Material Storage &amp; Transloading</h3>
        <p>Indoor and outdoor bulk material storage and rail-to-truck transload at one of the country's busiest rail interchange points, with truck access into the Port of Memphis corridor. Container stuffing and supersack / FIBC bulk bag packing available for resin and other bulk commodities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Rail</span>
        <h3>Rail-Served Warehousing &amp; Private Car Storage</h3>
        <p>Warehousing fed directly by private industrial rail siding, with private car storage available for overflow — a genuine alternative for shippers weighing rail-served industrial property across five converging Class I lines.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Processing</span>
        <h3>Toll Processing &amp; Contract Packaging</h3>
        <p>Cutting, blending, bagging, and repackaging for customers who need value added before material moves again.</p>
      </div>

